 "name_en": "Universal Parallel Accounting (6DF)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Universal Parallel Accounting (6DF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Universal parallel accounting ensures that the information in the general ledger, asset accounting, controlling and margin analysis is ledger-specific. This allows you to reflect valuation-specific processes in asset accounting and inventory valuation and reflect these costs consistently across the end-to-end value flow.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Deprecate fixed assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Handle allocations, activity Charging, and product Costs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform profitability analysis</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Accelerate the period close</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Remove manual work as all financial applications work within the ledger framework</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通用并行会计 (6DF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通用并行会计确保总账、资产会计、成本控制和利润率分析中的信息特定于分类账。这允许您在资产会计和库存评估中反映评估特定的流程，并在端到端价值流中一致地反映这些成本。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">折旧固定资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理分配、活动收费和产品成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行获利能力分析</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio789d50eb14df444985d568df63db1b1c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">加快期末结算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">由于所有财务应用程序均在分类账框架中工作，因此无需手动操作</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
